      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**First and last frame to video**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **First and last picture**: the top **Load Image** is the first picture, the bottom one is the last picture. Sample stills are loaded, so you can press **Run** right away.\n3. **Make the video**: the prompt says what happens between the two pictures.\n4. **Result**: press **Run**. The clip starts on the first picture and ends on the last one.\n\nA last frame always needs a first frame."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**First and last frame to video**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **First and last picture**: the top **Load Image** is the first picture, the bottom one is the last picture. Sample stills are loaded, so you can press **Run** right away.\n3. **Make the video**: the prompt says what happens between the two pictures.\n4. **Result**: press **Run**. The clip starts on the first picture and ends on the last one.\n\nA last frame always needs a first frame."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
